{
  "name": "CokeAI｜余额与到期提醒",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 用户余额 / 待办提醒\n\n每天北京时间 09:05 汇总：\n- 余额低于 ¥2 的活跃用户\n- 超过 2 小时未处理的人工订单\n- 待处理/失败的加额度队列\n- 在售/暂停模型数\n\n推送到运营 Webhook。不会自动向用户发消息，避免误发和骚扰。",
        "height": 210,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "e3e84d0a-9f45-4f7a-9b82-85822a922fc7",
      "name": "使用说明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -510,
        -70
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "5 9 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "645bcc6c-a1b3-4d0b-81b2-1d30f7e32c52",
      "name": "每天 09:05",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -40,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://app:3000/api/internal/reports/attention",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.INTERNAL_API_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "df3cb4f1-5f7e-4f90-8c28-8f4adf6c308a",
      "name": "拉取待关注用户",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        210,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const report = $input.first().json;\nconst lowBalance = report.low_balance || [];\nconst staleOrders = report.stale_pending_orders || [];\nconst formatCny = (micros) => `¥${(Number(micros || 0) / 1000000).toFixed(2)}`;\nconst ops = report.credit_ops || {};\nconst prices = report.prices || {};\n\nconst lines = [\n  'CokeAI 每日待办',\n  `余额低于 ¥2：${lowBalance.length}`,\n  `超 2 小时未处理订单：${staleOrders.length}`,\n  `加额度队列：待处理 ${ops.pending || 0}，失败 ${ops.failed || 0}`,\n  `模型价格：在售 ${prices.active || 0}，暂停 ${prices.paused || 0}`,\n];\n\nif (lowBalance.length) {\n  lines.push('', '低余额：');\n  for (const item of lowBalance.slice(0, 10)) {\n    lines.push(`- ${item.email}｜${formatCny(item.balance_micros)}`);\n  }\n}\n\nif (staleOrders.length) {\n  lines.push('', '待处理订单：');\n  for (const item of staleOrders.slice(0, 10)) {\n    lines.push(`- ${item.email}｜${formatCny(item.amount_micros)}｜${item.provider || ''}｜${item.created_at}`);\n  }\n}\n\nif (!$env.ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL) {\n  return [];\n}\n\nconst message = lines.join('\\n');\nreturn [{ json: { text: message, content: message } }];"
      },
      "id": "f91421c4-078f-478b-b2ae-bd5e211e304e",
      "name": "整理待办摘要",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        450,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "a30d9a4a-065a-441a-a1ed-2978d51229c1",
      "name": "推送运营提醒",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        690,
        80
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
